      "display": {},
      "inputs": {
        "color": "white",
        "content": "🚨 **Opportunity Risk Automation**\n\nThis automation does a *weekly* risk scan of open Salesforce opportunities and takes escalating actions based on the risk score.\n\nAn agent reviews open opportunities, scores their risk, then:\n- escalates **high**-risk deals\n- notifies owners of **medium** and **high**-risk deals\n- tags **every deal** with its risk level in Salesforce"
      }
    }
